        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax Sii Sheegid Ka Gees Ah Moo'aab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanu waa warka culus ee Moo'aab ku saabsan. Caartii Moo'aab habeen qudha baa lagu dumiyey oo baabba'shay; Qiirtii Moo'aab habeen qudha baa lagu dumiyey oo baabba'shay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaa kor loogu baxay Bayid iyo Diboon oo meelaha sare ku yaal in lagu ooyo, reer Moo'aab waxay u baroortaan Neboo iyo Meedebaa, madaxyadooda oo dhan waa la xiiray oo gadh kastana waa la jaray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jidadkooda waxaa lagu guntadaa dhar joonyad ah, oo guryahooda dushooda iyo jidadkooda ayaa mid kastaaba ka baroortaa isagoo aad u ooyaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Xeshboon iyo Elecaaleehba way qayliyaan, oo codkoodana waxaa laga maqlaa tan iyo Yahas, sidaas daraaddeed ragga hubka leh ee Moo'aab aad bay u qayliyaan, oo cabsi bay la gariiraan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qalbigaygu wuxuu u ooyaa reer Moo'aab, kuwoodii qaxay waxay u cararaan tan iyo Socar iyo ilaa Ceglad Shelishiyaah, waayo, oohin bay la fuulaan jiirta Luxiid, oo jidka Xororayimna waxay kor ugu qaadaan qaylo baabba'eed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, biyaha Nimriim baabba' bay noqon doonaan, cawskiina wuu engegay, biqilkiina wuu qallalay, oo wax cagaar ahna innaba lama arko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed maalkii badnaa ee ay urursadeen iyo wixii ay kaydsadeenba waxay u qaadan doonaan durdurka geedaha safsaafka ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, qayladii waxay gaadhay soohdimaha Moo'aab ku wareegsan, baroortoodii waxay gaadhay tan iyo Eglayim, oo baroortoodiina waxay gaadhay tan iyo Bi'ir Eelim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biyaha Diimoon dhiig baa ka buuxa, weliba waxaan Diimoon ku keeni doonaa belaayo kale, kan Moo'aab ka baxsaday iyo kuwa dalka ku hadhayba libaax baan ku diri doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
